{"items":[{"id":"5a4fecfd18c7","slug":"quipubase-una-base-de-datos-semantica-inspirada-en-el-quipu-andino-5a4fecfd18c7","title":"Quipubase: Una base de datos semántica inspirada en el quipu andino","date":"2025-08-04T08:33:37.000Z","excerpt":"“El futuro de los datos puede aprender del pasado.” Vivimos en una era donde los datos están en todas partes: APIs, bases vectoriales, LLMs, flujos JSON, modelos multimodales… pero ¿y si pensáramos nuestras estructuras de datos como redes vivas, narrativas, jerárquicas y culturalmente conscientes? De esa intuición nace Quipubase , una plataforma documental y semántica…","url":"https://medium.com/@obahamonde/quipubase-una-base-de-datos-sem%C3%A1ntica-inspirada-en-el-quipu-andino-5a4fecfd18c7","mediumUrl":"https://medium.com/p/5a4fecfd18c7","image":"","tags":["openai","ai","database"],"language":"es","readingMinutes":3},{"id":"1b0754aaace6","slug":"openai-in-a-box-oss-technical-design-of-the-silicon-valley-behemoth-1b0754aaace6","title":"OpenAI In a Box: OSS Technical Design of the Silicon Valley Behemoth","date":"2025-04-05T05:46:02.000Z","excerpt":"🌟 Overview OpenAI In a Box is an enterprise-grade, open-source implementation of the OpenAI-compatible API architecture, engineered to deploy seamlessly on AWS infrastructure while supporting the full spectrum of generative AI endpoints. This project delivers a self-hosted, horizontally scalable solution designed for organizations that require sovereign AI infrastructure with performance comparable to leading commercial providers.…","url":"https://python.plainenglish.io/openai-in-a-box-oss-technical-design-of-the-silicon-valley-behemoth-1b0754aaace6","mediumUrl":"https://medium.com/p/1b0754aaace6","image":"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/1*nLa0ochLpabYj8tW675G8w.png","tags":["deployment","model","infrastructure","capabilities"],"language":"en","readingMinutes":5},{"id":"22943f84d25a","slug":"memory-safety-meets-performance-the-power-of-modern-programming-languages-22943f84d25a","title":"Memory Safety Meets Performance: The Power of Modern Programming Languages","date":"2025-03-26T04:45:41.000Z","excerpt":"In the world of programming, the eternal quest for balance between performance and safety has led to the development of numerous languages, each with its own strengths and weaknesses. However, one language has been making waves in recent years with its unique approach to memory management, offering the best of both worlds: high-level simplicity with…","url":"https://medium.com/@obahamonde/memory-safety-meets-performance-the-power-of-modern-programming-languages-22943f84d25a","mediumUrl":"https://medium.com/p/22943f84d25a","image":"","tags":["programming-languages","memory-safety","performance"],"language":"en","readingMinutes":3},{"id":"3d729d316f13","slug":"evaluacion-comparativa-chatgpt-vs-llama-3-para-empresas-y-creadores-de-contenido-3d729d316f13","title":"Evaluación Comparativa: ChatGPT vs Llama 3 para Empresas y Creadores de Contenido","date":"2024-12-14T11:21:26.000Z","excerpt":"En un mundo donde la IA se vuelve cada vez más crucial para el trabajo intelectual, realizamos un análisis exhaustivo de dos modelos líderes: ChatGPT y Llama 3. El objetivo: determinar sus fortalezas y casos de uso óptimos. Metodología Desarrollamos un test de 10 preguntas enfocadas en: - Análisis estratégico - Resolución de problemas -…","url":"https://medium.com/@obahamonde/evaluaci%C3%B3n-comparativa-chatgpt-vs-llama-3-para-empresas-y-creadores-de-contenido-3d729d316f13","mediumUrl":"https://medium.com/p/3d729d316f13","image":"","tags":["ai","llama-3","chatgpt"],"language":"es","readingMinutes":2},{"id":"e8fd267e2375","slug":"genai-101-building-a-streaming-responses-chatbot-with-openai-client-gradio-and-g-e8fd267e2375","title":"[GenAI 101] Building a Streaming Responses Chatbot with OpenAI client, Gradio and Groq.","date":"2024-11-07T05:37:23.000Z","excerpt":"Welcome to “GenAI from Zero to Hero” — your guide to mastering Generative AI technologies! In this tutorial, we’ll create a real-time streaming chatbot using OpenAI Client on Groq API and Gradio to compose a rich UI. Introduction Chatbots have transformed how we interact with technology, offering instant support and engaging user experiences. Today, we’ll…","url":"https://blog.gopenai.com/genai-101-building-a-streaming-responses-chatbot-with-openai-client-gradio-and-groq-e8fd267e2375","mediumUrl":"https://medium.com/p/e8fd267e2375","image":"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1024/0*Oo2Eg8nbl_MbfzGs","tags":["large-language-models","python","artificial-intelligence"],"language":"en","readingMinutes":3},{"id":"2e88b80e190b","slug":"introduction-to-language-model-merging-2e88b80e190b","title":"Introduction to Language Model Merging","date":"2024-08-18T19:14:35.000Z","excerpt":"Language model merging is a next-level technique that combines multiple pretrained language models (LLMs) into a single, more powerful, and efficient model. This approach is a game-changer, allowing you to supercharge your models without the hassle of retraining from scratch, saving both time and compute — because who has time for that? Why Merge Models?…","url":"https://ai.plainenglish.io/introduction-to-language-model-merging-2e88b80e190b","mediumUrl":"https://medium.com/p/2e88b80e190b","image":"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1024/1*w-Jz28URZgk65h-pkMY6Mw.png","tags":["technology","ai","llama-3","llm","nlp"],"language":"en","readingMinutes":4}],"page":1,"pages":2,"total":10,"stale":false}